{
  "name": "Airbnb & VRBO Short-Term Rental Nightly Rates, Cleaning Fees & Occupancy Comps",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Airbnb & VRBO Short-Term Rental Nightly Rates, Cleaning Fees & Occupancy Comps\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nAnalyze competitor Airbnb and VRBO listings for nightly pricing, Superhost status, and review velocity in any US market.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/airbnb-vrbo-short-term-rental-market-analyzer`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/airbnb-vrbo-short-term-rental-market-analyzer) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Airbnb & VRBO Nightly Rates & Fees Scraper** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "14e8afa2-a8bd-456f-ab35-a2faea399ba1",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Airbnb & VRBO Nightly Rates & Fees Scraper** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "cf04ac62-daf9-416a-ac72-1a4557f64cba",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "b8089db1-3d78-485c-af04-9c721211cfb1",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "bc1c4596-2ef2-4426-a228-91a1e1a7d4bf",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
